# This directory contains framework junctions/symlinks
# These link to:
#   - omnetpp-5.6.1/        → ../../omnetpp-5.6.1
#   - inet-4.2.2/           → ../../inet-4.2.2-src/inet4
#   - veins-5.2/            → ../../veins-5.2/veins-veins-5.2
#   - simu5g-1.1.0/         → ../../Simu5G-1.1.0/Simu5G-1.1.0
#
# Junctions are created by the setup script or manually with:
#   mklink /J external\<name> <target>
#
# On systems without admin privileges, GNUmakefile falls back
# to direct workspace paths.
